cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CT Low-Dose Simulator"
abstract: >-
  A desktop application that simulates reduced-dose CT images from
  routine-dose DICOM series by projection-domain noise insertion.
  The target dose is set relative to the mAs recorded in the DICOM header,
  and the noise level is calibrated against the noise measured in the
  original image.
